    <string name="how_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="how_body">1. Type in any app: Fiverr, WhatsApp, Gmail…\n2. Select the text, then tap <b>Text Fixer</b> in the menu (it may be under ⋮).\n3. Check the preview and tap <b>Replace</b>.\n\nTo answer a message: select it and tap <b>Text Fixer Reply</b>.

Or open Text Fixer and use <b>Paste &amp; fix</b>, or Share any text to Text Fixer.</string>
